{{Debuffnotes
| name = Headshot
| desc = The {{M|forced movement}} applied no longer affects the [[debuff immune]] enemy unit.
}}

{{Debuffnotes
| name = Concussive Grenade
| desc = The {{M|forced movement}} component is not interrupted if the [[debuff immune]] source is applied while being knocked back.<br><br>Hence, a knocked back but debuff immune-affected unit can issue any commands as per normal during the knockback.
}}
{{Rootnotes
| name = Concussive Grenade
| desc = [[Root]] sources do not interrupt the ability if already leaping backward.<br><br>Can be cast while rooted, but does not apply the self {{M|knockback}} component.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Concussive Grenade
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus shd}} Requires drafting {{A|Sniper|Assassinate}} to unlock this ability.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Concussive Grenade icon0}}
| desc = Launches a grenade at the target area, dealing damage to enemies and knocking them and Sniper back. Enemies affected are disarmed and have their movement slowed after the knockback.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Concussive Grenade basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}} until reaching the {{Symbol|Target|Area|Alt}} area-targeted location.

* Has the following ability interactions with {{M|debuff immunity}} sources:
** The {{M|stun}} component applied do not affect debuff immune enemy units.
** Despite {{M|forced movement}} sources being able to interact with debuff immunity sources, it is not applied to debuff immune enemy units.
** Hence, the knockback component does not affect debuff immune enemy units.

{{Rootnotes
| name = Concussive Grenade
| desc = [[Root]] sources do not interrupt the ability if already leaping backward.<br><br>Can be cast while rooted, but does not apply the self {{M|knockback}} component.
}}

{{Debuffnotes
| name = Assassinate
| desc = Both the {{M|True Sight}} and the {{M|shared vision}} component affects [[debuff immune]] units.
}}
{{Disjointnotes
| name = Assassinate
| desc = Only {{M|invisibility}} sources with {{M|True Sight immunity}} can disjoint the {{M|projectile}}.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Assassinate
| is_behavenormal = yes
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus agh}} The ability upgrade removes this restriction and utilizes the {{A|Rubick|Stolen Spell 1|text=Stolen Spells'}} cast point.
}} 
{{Splduplicatenotes
| name = Assassinate
| desc = The secondary {{M|projectile}} is fired immediately afterward to the secondary target after the {{M|cast animation}} at the primary {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy.
}}

{{Disjointnotes
| name = Assassinate
| desc = Only {{M|invisibility}} sources with {{M|True Sight immunity}} can disjoint the {{M|projectile}}.
}}

fields.value:
 * {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Conditional}}
** Keen Scope is a bonus [[conditional attack damage]] source and has the following properties:
*** The attack distance to bonus attack damage values are directly added to Sniper's attack damage in the {{M|combat log}} and not displayed on the [[HUD]].
*** The bonus conditional attack damage value is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Σ[[Attack Damage|AtkDmg]] × ({{#var:Keen Scope value2}} + {{#var:Keen Scope basic1}} × SelfLvl) × ([[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌈]] [[Wikipedia:Absolute_value|{{!}}]] SniperPosition - AttackedEnemyPosition [[Wikipedia:Absolute_value|{{!}}]] / {{#var:Keen Scope value1}} [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions⌋|⌉]] )}}
*** For {{A|Sniper|Assassinate}}, the {{Symbol|bonus cas}} bonus damage value is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Σ[[Attack Damage|AtkDmg]] × ({{#var:Keen Scope value2}} + {{#var:Keen Scope basic1}} × SelfLvl) × ([[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌈]]  CastDistance / {{#var:Keen Scope value1}} [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions⌋|⌉]] )}}
** Does not interact with the following sources:
*** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
*** Percentage-based {{M|bonus attack damage|x}} sources.
** Interacts with the following sources:
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**** {{M|Lifesteal}} sources.
**** {{M|Critical strike}} sources.
**** {{M|Cleave}} sources.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** {{M|Damage block}} sources.

* {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
** {{A|Sniper|Assassinate}} applies another independent {{M|physical}} {{M|attack damage}} instance upon [[projectile]] impact.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Keen Scope icon0}}
| desc = Sniper’s attacks deal bonus damage for every 100 units of distance Sniper is from the target.
}}

