fields.value:
{{Stealnotes
| name = Shrapnel 
| desc = Grants all {{M|charges}} immediately upon acquiring the ability.<br><br>Subsequent ability re-acquisition only grants the remaining charges.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Charges}}
** Learning the ability grants all [[charges]] immediately.

* [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-8-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-8-2.png|84px]]
** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{calc|v1+{{#var:Shrapnel cast range}}|v1={{#var:Shrapnel value1}}}}-distance away with the [[cast range]] and [[effect radius]].
** {{Symbol|Aura}}
*** {{#var:Shrapnel value2}} seconds after casting, Shrapnel creates a negative [[aura]] that applies all ability effects at {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} area-targeted location [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] with the following properties:
**** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|sniper_shrapnel_slow}} 
***** Deals {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} to affected enemy units in 1-second intervals within the radius, immediately upon debuff application, over {{#expr:{{#var:Shrapnel value5}}+1}} damage instances.
***** The following sources update all current Shrapnel instance:
****** Leveling up the ability.
****** Learning both the {{ValueColor||slow increasing|15tal}} and {{ValueColor||damage increasing|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t2l3l|text=talents}}.
***** However, the already applied debuff on enemy units do not update.
**** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
***** Grants a 450-radius [[flying vision]] centered around the effect radius for the entire duration.
*** Does not affect the following units:
**** {{M|Buildings}}
**** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
** {{Symbol|Target|Area-Inter}}
*** Multiple overlapping Shrapnel radius do not stack.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Shrapnel icon0}}
| desc = Consumes a charge to launch a ball of shrapnel that showers the target area in explosive pellets. Enemies are subject to damage and slowed movement. Reveals the targeted area. Shrapnel charges restore every 35 seconds.
}}
* Deals {{calc|v1*({{#var:Shrapnel value5}}+1)|v1={{#var:Shrapnel value3}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|trunc(v1*(1+{{Show|T|Sniper|v1l}}%)*({{#var:Shrapnel value5}}+1))|v1={{#var:Shrapnel value3}}}}|tal|x}}) total {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]) within the radius for the entire duration per {{M|charge}}.

